OL,3,CPerez Hilton 'serious but stable' with
OL,4,Clong recovery ahead, family says
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fsome readers may find distressing
OL,9,FPerez Hilton is in a "serious but
OL,10,Fstable" condition after his admission
OL,11,Fto hospital, his family said in a
OL,12,Fstatement posted to his website which
OL,13,Fadded that "his treatment and recovery
OL,14,Fwill be a long process".
OL,16,FEmergency services were seen outside
OL,17,Fthe celebrity blogger's home in Miami
OL,18,Fon Tuesday after members of the public
OL,19,Freported seeing him self-harm in a
OL,20,Flivestream.
