OL,3,CPerez Hilton 'serious but stable' with
OL,4,Clong recovery ahead, family says
OL,6,FHis account was suspended minutes
OL,7,Flater.
OL,9,FIn a post to his Perez Hilton website,
OL,10,Fhis family said Hilton, 48, remains in
OL,11,Fhospital, adding: "Perez's condition
OL,12,Fremains serious but stable.
OL,14,F"He experienced significant blood loss
OL,15,Fand sustained additional injuries that
OL,16,Fwill require surgery in the coming
OL,17,Fdays.
OL,19,F"His treatment and recovery will be a
OL,20,Flong process.
OL,26,@sD@SOUvD@AOU{D@AOU
