OL,3,CPerez Hilton 'serious but stable' with
OL,4,Clong recovery ahead, family says
OL,6,F"We are grateful that Perez was able
OL,7,Fto spend time with his mother and
OL,8,Fsister yesterday."
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FThe statement said "his communication
OL,16,Fhas been extremely limited and
OL,17,Fconfined to immediate family, medical
OL,18,Fproviders, and others directly
OL,19,Finvolved in his care", adding that
OL,20,FHilton "has not communicated with the
OL,21,Fmedia or issued any public statements".
