OL,3,CPerez Hilton 'serious but stable' with
OL,4,Clong recovery ahead, family says
OL,6,FHis website was the only place where
OL,7,F"credible and authorised" updates
OL,8,Fwould be given, the statement added.
OL,10,F"As our family remains focused on
OL,11,FPerez's treatment and recovery, we
OL,12,Falso need the space and privacy to
OL,13,Fcare for everyone affected by this
OL,14,Fsituation."
OL,16,FHilton's family and team previously
OL,17,Fdetailed how it has been an
OL,18,F"incredibly difficult" and
OL,19,F"heartbreaking" time for them.
