OL,3,CPerez Hilton 'serious but stable' with
OL,4,Clong recovery ahead, family says
OL,6,FIn a statement to media on Tuesday,
OL,7,Fthe Miami-Dade Sheriff's Office
OL,8,Fconfirmed they attended a scene of a
OL,9,Fman "livestreaming acts of self-harm",
OL,10,Fbut did not name Hilton.
OL,12,FDeputies confirmed the man was alone
OL,13,Fin the house at the time.
OL,15,FHilton, whose real name is Mario
OL,16,FArmando Lavandeira Jr, rose to fame in
OL,17,Fthe 2000s as a celebrity gossip
OL,18,Fblogger.
