OL,6,FHis caustic attitude towards the stars
OL,7,Fhe covered received criticism at the
OL,8,Ftime, along with his practice of
OL,9,F"outing" closeted gay celebrities.
OL,11,FThe popularity of Hilton's blog
OL,12,Feventually declined, and he moved into
OL,13,Fa career in reality television,
OL,14,Fappearing on shows including Celebrity
OL,15,FRap Superstar and Celebrity Big
OL,16,FBrother.
